> Alright, , I tried to come up with everything I could that wasn't too
> far away from the subject of politics and economics.=A0 I thought of
> adding things in like nazi-ism or maoism, but they seemed to be too
> specific for this beginning list.=A0 I'm sure there's more, so feel free
